  "releaseNotes": "Adds the Dev versioning release type for non-release builds. It preserves\n      Major.Minor.Build and uses Revision 1 as a fixed marker, keeping testing-branch builds\n      distinct from date-driven Release and Preview versions. CHANGELOG.md contains the complete\n      details.",
